nks to the team at Cook Medical and Cook Research Incorporated, particularly Nicholas D. Dey, for his contributions to medical writing, including data review, summary and editorial assistance, and Simon Brouwers for his invaluable support in performing all procedures. We extend our appreciation to Prof. Juan Abraldes, who served as an independent reviewer for the HVPG tracings in this study. Cook Research Incorporated also wishes to acknowledge the contributions of Dr. Kenneth J. Chang and Dr. William Brugge. We would like to acknowledge Prof Rob de Man for his valuable contributions to the conceptualization of the study. Lastly, we would like to honor the contributions of Dr. Adriaan Moelker, who sadly passed away during the course of this study.</p></ack><fn-group><fn id="appsec2" fn-type="supplementary-material"><p id="p0230">Supplementary data to this article can be found online at <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jhepr.2025.101466" id="intref0015">https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jhepr.2025.101466</ext-link>.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>